  "beats": [
    {
      "t": "2026-11-03T00:00:01Z",
      "text": "Several states elected their first Democratic representatives in decades, including Adam Hamilton, the first Democrat to win a Kansas Senate seat since 1932.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-03:12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-03T00:00:08Z",
      "text": "According to the Wikipedia article, on 2 November 2026 de Miguel suffered a blunt cardiac injury in a collision with FC Andorra goalkeeper Jesús Owono, which caused him to go into cardiac arrest.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1384119673:26"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-03T00:00:15Z",
      "text": "Jesús de Miguel Alameda, born 21 September 1996 and died 3 November 2026, was a Spanish professional footballer who played as a striker.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1384119673:0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-03T00:00:25Z",
      "text": "Jesús de Miguel Alameda was born on 21 September 1996 in Madrid.",
      "cites": [
        "wd:Q116992476:P569",
        "wd:Q116992476:P19"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-03T00:00:33Z",
      "text": "Between 2015 and 2026 he played for 8 clubs, starting with CD Leganés B and ending with C.D. Tenerife.",
      "cites": [
        "wd:Q116992476:P54:Q9196665",
        "wd:Q116992476:P54:Q9008987",
        "wd:Q116992476:P54:Q108708",
        "wd:Q116992476:P54:Q4651246",
        "wd:Q116992476:P54:Q840620",
        "wd:Q116992476:P54:Q20278773",
        "wd:Q116992476:P54:Q743557",
        "wd:Q116992476:P54:Q216661"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-03T00:00:43Z",
      "text": "He died on 3 November 2026 at Hospital Universitario Nuestra Señora de Candelaria, aged 30.",
      "cites": [
        "wd:Q116992476:P570",
        "wd:Q116992476:P20",
        "wd:Q116992476:P569"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-03T00:00:51Z",
      "text": "On the same day, readers also looked up goalkeeper Jesús Owono, with 297,789 readers, and CD Tenerife, with 70,752.",
      "cites": [
        "views:en:Jesús_Owono:2026-11-03",
        "views:en:CD_Tenerife:2026-11-03"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-03T00:01:00Z",
      "text": "On 3 November 2026, 585,060 people read about him, while in the weeks before, the article drew a median of 4 readers a day, so almost nobody read it.",
      "cites": [
        "views:en:Jesús_de_Miguel:2026-11-03",
        "views:en:Jesús_de_Miguel:prior"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-03T00:01:07Z",
      "text": "The article was read in 8 languages, and after English the most readers were in Spanish, with 367,049.",
      "cites": [
        "views:en:Jesús_de_Miguel:2026-11-03",
        "views:es:Jesús_de_Miguel_Alameda:2026-11-03"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-03T00:01:14Z",
      "text": "On the globe, each language glows where it is mainly spoken, brighter for more readers; a language is not a country.",
      "cites": [
        "views:es:Jesús_de_Miguel_Alameda:2026-11-03",
        "views:de:Jesús_de_Miguel:2026-11-03",
        "views:ar:خيسوس_دي_ميغيل:2026-11-03",
        "views:fr:Jesús_de_Miguel:2026-11-03",
        "views:ru:Де_Мигель,_Хесус_(футболист):2026-11-03",
        "views:fa:خسوس_د_میگل:2026-11-03"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-03T00:01:24Z",
      "text": "NBC News and Axios reported the story.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-03:12"
      ]
    },
